MAD Installer — component licensing
===================================

The files of this component (components/mad-install) that carry the
SPDX-License-Identifier "CC0-1.0" are project-original Echo OS work and are
released under CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication):

    CC0 1.0 Universal
    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

to the extent legally possible. The Echo OS mark (echo-mark.svg and its
derivatives in calamares/branding/mad/) is project-original artwork of the
Echo OS project.

Third-party components are NOT re-licensed by this file:

  - The Calamares runtime is GPL-3.0-or-later and is distributed as its own
    package (components/mad-install/packages/PKGBUILD); its license texts
    and copyright notices ship with that package and remain intact.
  - Files derived from Calamares' own branding example retain their original
    SPDX headers where present.

No legally required third-party attribution has been removed in the
branding transition from Echo Install to MAD Installer.
